@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Sans
title Native timing: valve and controller
footer Integer times; native waveform and ribbon layout
robust "Valve track" as V
concise "Controller track" as C
@0
V is Closed
C is Waiting
@+6
V is Open
C is Running
@+9
V is Closed
C is Done
V@6 <-> @+9 : open interval
V@6 -> C@8 : confirm
@20
@enduml
